  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Transportation Infrastructure Exchange, through Meridian International Center</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA supported the Transportation Infrastructure Exchange Program, which brought Indian officials and project sponsors to the United States for a series of two reverse trade missions (RTM) focused on the ports and rail sector. The objective of this program was to familiarize members of the delegation with U.S. infrastructure technologies and to facilitate business partnerships between key ports and rail sector stakeholders in the United States and India.</narrative>
  </description>
